WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.480
Where does sugar go when it dissolves in tea?

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.950
It doesn't vanish.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:11.380
The sugar breaks into particles too small to see.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:15.120
They spread between the water particles.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:21.013
Taste it: it's still there.
